<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Roadmap | Caravan Park Tycoon</title><style>:root{--bg:#081018;--surface:#101c26;--border:#ffffff18;--accent:#fbbf24;--text:#f8fafc;--muted:#a8b6c4}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font:16px/1.7 system-ui,sans-serif}.wrap{max-width:900px;margin:auto;padding:1.5rem}header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding-bottom:1.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}nav{display:flex;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap}nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}main{padding:5rem 0}.eyebrow{color:var(--accent);font:500 .78rem monospace;text-transform:uppercase}.item{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;padding:1.5rem;margin-top:1rem}.item p{color:var(--muted)}h1{font-size:4rem;line-height:1;margin:.7rem 0}</style></head><body><div class="wrap"><header><a href="/"><Logo size={42}/></a><nav><a href="/games/caravan-park-tycoon">Game</a><a href="/games/caravan-park-tycoon/development">Development</a><a href="/games/caravan-park-tycoon/features">Features</a><a href="/games/caravan-park-tycoon/expansions">Expansions</a></nav></header><main><div class="eyebrow">Caravan Park Tycoon</div><h1>Roadmap</h1><div class="item"><h2>Milestone 1 · Playable park foundation</h2><p>Static starting playfield, core building placement, basic pitches and the first management loop.</p></div><div class="item"><h2>Milestone 2 · Guests & simulation</h2><p>Guests, needs, pathfinding, income and park beauty become part of the core loop.</p></div><div class="item"><h2>Milestone 3 · Content & personality</h2><p>Facilities, characters, events, secrets and the visual identity of the park.</p></div><div class="item"><h2>Beyond · Expansions</h2><p>Future content can extend the game without taking over the main studio site.</p></div></main></div><BobTheSeagull/></body></html>